        "original_id": "a045c0e4-009a-5e0d-90ad-be2b6176bbde",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: A Perfect Murder, Dial M for Murder, North by Northwest, 3 A.M., Gloria\n- People: Andrew Davis, Alfred Hitchcock, Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, Viggo Mortensen, Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, John Williams, Sarita Choudhury, Cary Grant, Eva Marie Saint, James Mason\n\nFacts:\n- Dial M for Murder is a 1954 American crime mystery film directed by Alfred Hitchcock and starring Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, and John Williams.\n- North by Northwest is a 1959 American thriller directed by Alfred Hitchcock and starring Cary Grant, Eva Marie Saint, and James Mason.\n- A Perfect Murder is a 1998 American crime thriller film directed by Andrew Davis and starring Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, and Viggo Mortensen.\n- In the late 1990s, Sarita Choudhury expanded her repertoire with supporting roles in A Perfect Murder, 3 A.M., and Gloria.",
